        { "lines": [1], "note": "The loop gives us each number, one at a time." },
        { "lines": [2], "note": "The if checks a condition on EACH number. The % operator gives the remainder — if remainder is 0, it's even." },
        { "lines": [3], "note": "This only runs for even numbers (2, 4, 6)." }
      ]
    },
